S.push(P0(`Every preprocessing step was checked for use of test units. Regime z-scores and the removal of constant sensors use the training (or fit) units of each split; regimes are obtained by rounding the operating settings, without fitting; the N-CMAPSS channels were fixed in the protocol; bearing condition statistics come from training bearings, pooled when a condition has no training bearing; the threshold grid of the health-indicator alarm, the constant of the constant-estimate control and the capacity thresholds come from training values. The one dependency found was the block length κ of the battery and bearing data (Section 5.2 of the main text), which has been corrected, together with a backward fill of missing per-cycle battery values within a cell.`));

